       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SPCSQUOT.
       AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   SEPTEMBER 1995.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SPCSQUOT    QUOTE INFORMATION SUBPROGRAM                *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO ENTER THE QUOTE HEADINGS,      *
      *D    QUOTE RETURN ADDRESS AND QUOTE STND INSTRUCTIONS.      *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    ** COPIED FROM SQTEINFO AND MODIFIED **                *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTARTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DQUOTEXT-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                       PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
       FD  DQUOTEXT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3800 OF MCFLCS3801.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  LINE-NO                    PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1          PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2          PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DQUOTEXT IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                    PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                           PIC Z(11)9.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  QUOTE-INFO-SCREEN.
           05  QUOTE-HEADING1            PIC X(60).
           05  QUOTE-HEADING2            PIC X(12).
           05  QUOTE-HEADING3            PIC X(45).
           05  ALT-QUOTE-RETURN-ADDRESS.
               10  QUOTE-ADDRESS1        PIC X(60).
               10  QUOTE-ADDRESS2        PIC X(60).
               10  QUOTE-ADDRESS3        PIC X(60).
           05  QUOTE-INST-TBL.
               10  QUOTE-INST
                   OCCURS 5 TIMES        PIC X(72).
      *    05  QUOTE-MSGLINE             PIC X(79).
           05  QUOTE-CMDLINE             PIC X(79).
           05  QUOTE-ERROR-MSGLINE       PIC X(79).
       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).

       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.


      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.


       MAIN-PGM SECTION 01.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "SPCSQUOT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O, DQUOTEXT-O.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O, DQUOTEXT-O.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.


      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "QUOTINFO" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO QUOTE-INFO-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 61-READ-MPLTINFO.
           PERFORM 61-READ-DQUOTEXT.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
      *    MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
      *    MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
      *    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
      *    MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO QUOTE-MSGLINE.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE QUOTE-INFO-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC       TO QUOTE-INFO-SCREEN.

       6-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO QUOTE-ERROR-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "QTH1" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING1 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING1
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "1REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTH1"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING1 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING1
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "1WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "1READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "QTH2" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING2 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING2
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTH2"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING2 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING2
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "2READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "QTH3" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING3 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING3
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "3REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTH3"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-HEADING3 TO MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING3
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "3WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "3READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "QTA1" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS1 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "4REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTA1"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS1 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "4WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "4READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "QTA2" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS2 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "5REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTA2"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS2 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "5WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "5READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "QTA3" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS3 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "6REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "QTA3"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE QUOTE-ADDRESS3 TO MPLTINFO-DATA
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "6WRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "6READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

       6-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT.
           MOVE "STAND" TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           MOVE ZEROS   TO ITEMNO   OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           START DQUOTEXT-O KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               PERFORM 61-DELETE-DQUOTEXT THRU 61-DD-X
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "START  ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT" TO
                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .
           MOVE 1 TO LINE-NO.
           PERFORM 61-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT UNTIL LINE-NO > 5.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT.
           MOVE "STAND" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE "STAND" TO DQUOTEXT-QUOTE-NO.
           MOVE "0000"  TO DQUOTEXT-ITM-NO.
           MOVE LINE-NO TO DQUOTEXT-LINE-NO.
           MOVE QUOTE-INST (LINE-NO) TO DQUOTEXT-DATA.
           WRITE DQUOTEXT-O-REC FROM BUF-DQUOTEXT
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "PUT DQUOTEXT ERROR IN 61-R-D"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .
           ADD 1 TO LINE-NO.

       61-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "QTH1" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING1 TO QUOTE-HEADING1
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE " T H E   G O O D Y E A R   T I R E   A N D   R U B     "&
      -     "B E R   C" TO QUOTE-HEADING1
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "1READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTH1" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

           MOVE "QTH2" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING2 TO QUOTE-HEADING2
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE " O M P A N Y"  TO QUOTE-HEADING2
           ELSE
               MOVE "2READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTH2" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

           MOVE "QTH3" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-QUOTE-HEADING3 TO QUOTE-HEADING3
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "     V E N D O R   Q U O T E   S H E E T     "
                   TO QUOTE-HEADING3
           ELSE
               MOVE "3READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTH3" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

           MOVE "QTA1" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS1
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "P 01" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
      *            INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS1
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES TO QUOTE-ADDRESS1
           ELSE
               MOVE "4READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTA1" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

           MOVE "QTA2" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS2
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "P 10" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
      *            INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS2
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES TO QUOTE-ADDRESS2
           ELSE
               MOVE "5READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTA1" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

           MOVE "QTA3" TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS3
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "P 11" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               READ MPLTINFO-O   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
      *            INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-DATA TO QUOTE-ADDRESS3
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES TO QUOTE-ADDRESS3
           ELSE
               MOVE "6READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "QTA1" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP  .

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       61-READ-DQUOTEXT.
           MOVE "STAND" TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           MOVE ZEROS   TO ITEMNO   OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           START DQUOTEXT-O   KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                  MOVE "QUOTE ONLY FIRM PRICES - NO HIGHER PRICE TO BE P    "&
      -        "AID AT TIME OF SHIPMENT." TO QUOTE-INST (1)
                  MOVE "BID INDIVIDUAL ITEM PRICES - DO NOT BID LOT PRIC    "&
      -        "ES.  IF QUANTITY " TO QUOTE-INST (2)
                  MOVE "DISCOUNTS ARE AVAILABLE, PLEASE NOTE THESE ALSO.    "&
      -        "  FOR NON-STOCK " TO QUOTE-INST (3)
                  MOVE "ITEMS SHOW LEAD TIMES." TO QUOTE-INST (4)
                  MOVE SPACES                   TO QUOTE-INST (5)
           ELSE
               PERFORM 61-GET-DQUOTEXT THRU 61-GD-X
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
               MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC
               START DQUOTEXT-O KEY > QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC
                   INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       61-GET-DQUOTEXT.
           READ DQUOTEXT-O   NEXT INTO BUF-DQUOTEXT
               AT END GO TO 61-GD-X.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 61-GD-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "READN DQUOTEXT ERROR IN 61-GET-DQUOTEXT"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE "STAND/0000" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC NOT = "STAND"
               GO TO 61-GD-X.
           IF DQUOTEXT-ITM-NO = "0000"
               MOVE DQUOTEXT-DATA TO QUOTE-INST (DQUOTEXT-LINE-NO).
           GO TO 61-GET-DQUOTEXT.
       61-GD-X.
           EXIT.

       61-DELETE-DQUOTEXT.
           READ DQUOTEXT-O   NEXT INTO BUF-DQUOTEXT
               AT END GO TO 61-GD-X.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 61-DD-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "READN DQUOTEXT ERROR IN 61-DEL-DQUOTEXT"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE "STAND/0000" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC NOT = "STAND"
               GO TO 61-DD-X.
           IF DQUOTEXT-ITM-NO = "0000"
               DELETE DQUOTEXT-O
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                  MOVE "DELETE DQUOTEXT ERROR IN 61-DELETE-DQUOTEXT"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  MOVE "STAND/0000" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                  GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           GO TO 61-DELETE-DQUOTEXT.
       61-DD-X.
           EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
